1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,533
Part one. Setting up your profile.

2
00:00:02,533 --> 00:00:05,897
You do this once, and then you are done with it.

3
00:00:06,197 --> 00:00:09,690
Every job application asks you for the same things.

4
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:12,635
Your name, your phone number, your address,

5
00:00:12,635 --> 00:00:15,306
your résumé, a signature at the bottom.

6
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:16,471
Even your gender,

7
00:00:16,471 --> 00:00:22,429
which this app only ever asks so it can answer that question when a form insists on it.

8
00:00:22,429 --> 00:00:24,142
Fill it in here one time,

9
00:00:24,142 --> 00:00:27,840
and it is carried into every form you meet after that.

10
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:31,144
Open the menu, and tap Account Settings.

11
00:00:31,444 --> 00:00:36,913
Your photo, name, email, phone, address, date of birth.

12
00:00:37,213 --> 00:00:40,427
Then attach your résumé, straight from your phone.

13
00:00:40,727 --> 00:00:43,301
That is the file it attaches for you later.

14
00:00:43,601 --> 00:00:47,887
No signature? It draws one from your name. Pick a style.

15
00:00:48,187 --> 00:00:50,355
Save, and the setup is done.

16
00:00:50,655 --> 00:00:55,561
Next, we turn that into a résumé built for the country you are applying to.

